      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": 600,
      "details": "<p>Atyantak\u0101ma-pallave\u015bvara-g\u1e5bha is attested as the name of several\u00a0seventh-century Pallava rock-cut and cave temples in Mah\u0101balipuram. Furthermore many of the verses of the inscription of the Ga\u1e47e\u015baratha are found verbatim on other Pallava monuments of the same period. It is thus not to be excluded that Atyantak\u0101ma-pallave\u015bvara-g\u1e5bha is a later name of the original foundation, given not long after the actual foundation. The original name of the temple, if any, is unknown.</p>",
